  "prefLabel": "Puc 2502.01 Alternative compliance payment",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-05-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2502.01 “Alternative compliance payment” means a payment that a provider of electricity must remit to the commission for each renewable energy certificate in lieu of retiring certificates to meet the portfolio standards of Puc 2503 for a given year as required by RSA 362-F:10, II.\n\nSource. #9037, INTERIM, eff 11-27-07, EXPIRED: 5-25-08\n\nNew. #9169, eff 6-3-08; ss by #10741, eff 12-5-14 (from Puc 2502.02); ss by #12473, eff 2-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc2500.html"
